{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18102240","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18102240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1810224001:0":{"text":"You must be here for the merch! Anyone can tell you're a loyal Senea fan from that outfit.","source_cn":"哇哦，一看你们就是来领剧目纪念品的。只有塞涅小姐的忠实...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x18931EF3EAEBDAEC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You must be here for the merch! Anyone can tell you're a loyal Senea fan from that outfit.","female":"You must be here for the merch! Anyone can tell you're a loyal Senea fan from that outfit.","variant_male_record_index":"240006","variant_female_record_index":"240007","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::0":{"text":"Souvenir","source_cn":"纪念品","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC9D1756EAF784D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810224002:0":{"text":"Here you go!","source_cn":"来，这是本次剧目的纪念品！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x69C10B6A3DC4C49E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Here you go!","female":"Here you go!","variant_male_record_index":"240008","variant_female_record_index":"240009","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810224003:0":{"text":"Wait, a red flower? The symbol of this show is supposed to be a white rose. And besides, Senea doesn't even like red.","source_cn":"咦……为什么是红色的花？这场戏的代表物明明是白玫瑰，而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEC4354E92D33330","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810224004:0":{"text":"This show was put together for her death anniversary, so Senea had the script rewritten by famous playwrights. The new symbol reflects those changes.","source_cn":"本次演出的剧目是塞涅小姐“忌辰”特别场，为此塞涅小姐花...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98A46F9647C84646","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810224005:0":{"text":"Is this the long-awaited finale of the Lost Voice storyline?!","source_cn":"《消逝之声》终于要有圆满结局了吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE28BD82F2B6FB869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810224006:0":{"text":"No spoilers from me! Just enjoy the surprise when it comes!","source_cn":"那我就不能透露了，把惊喜留到正式演出的时候吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3AE362204E68D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810224007:0":{"text":"And trust me, that's not even the biggest one the show has in store.","source_cn":"不过我可以悄悄告诉你，待会还会有更大的惊喜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD80929B73E09FF34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810224008:0":{"text":"There's an even bigger surprise? What's that?","source_cn":"更大的惊喜？什么什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x861A3FC39C3C4462","variant_status":"",